WEBVTT

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:04.830
a useful tool within word is the final

00:00:02.399 --> 00:00:06.540
éclairs tool this allows you to search

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:08.330
through a document for a specific word

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:10.620
and then replace it with another word

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:12.750
this could be very useful if you have a

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:15.389
large document and you need to find

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:18.119
instances of a word that may appear 100

00:00:15.389 --> 00:00:20.970
200 times and it needs to be changed

00:00:18.119 --> 00:00:22.680
quickly as an example I have a letter on

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:24.600
the screen and where I'm going to use

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:28.650
the final replace tool to change the

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:30.269
word data to information there are

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:32.719
several instances of the word theatre

00:00:30.269 --> 00:00:36.480
and so I click on the editing tool

00:00:32.719 --> 00:00:40.050
select replace and the word I'm looking

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:45.180
for is deer and going to replace that

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:47.910
with information there are three options

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:50.399
here so you can replace and that will

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:52.140
replace each instance one at a time so

00:00:50.399 --> 00:00:54.329
you can just confirm that this is okay

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:56.520
or you can select the place order this

00:00:54.329 --> 00:00:58.859
will automatically the whole document

00:00:56.520 --> 00:01:02.309
and replace every instance of the word

00:00:58.859 --> 00:01:04.080
theatre with information it's good to be

00:01:02.309 --> 00:01:06.150
careful with this because there may be

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:09.540
certain words are a part of other words

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:11.580
an example of this is Nate aim name

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:14.820
Mayer so if you are looking to change

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:16.710
the word Nate into something else and

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:18.360
those words were present in that

00:01:16.710 --> 00:01:19.920
document it would automatically change

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:22.680
the first part of that word into

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:25.439
whatever he had decided to change it

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:27.509
into so for this one here I'm just going

00:01:25.439 --> 00:01:29.939
to change deer I with information and

00:01:27.509 --> 00:01:32.400
I'll go through one of the temps for

00:01:29.939 --> 00:01:33.689
select replace as you can see it's

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:37.170
highlighted the word deer died so I

00:01:33.689 --> 00:01:40.490
click replace the second instances

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:44.670
appeared click the place and replace the

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:47.479
place where there's no finish search in

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:50.579
the document and I can close up and

00:01:47.479 --> 00:01:54.470
every instance of the word theater has

00:01:50.579 --> 00:01:54.470
been replaced with the word information